# Select molecular diffusion and unresolved dispersion independently through
# multicomponent_onsager_diffusion.i.template and
# multicomponent_onsager_dispersion.i.template. Their separate current-volume
# flux families are pulled back and stitched into the component balances as
# independent ADReferenceComponentFluxTerm contributions.
# When the independent potentials themselves use CG/EG, also instantiate
# multicomponent_onsager_block_eg.i.template once per two-component block (or
# repeat its row/column pattern for arbitrary N-1). This supplies the
# off-diagonal interior-facet, adjoint-consistency, and weak-boundary terms;
# omitting them changes the discrete multicomponent operator.
